[Cheats\Enable Debug Menu]
description=Enable Debug Menu allows quick access to images, sounds, character routes, story scenes, debug/test menus, save, and system flags. Hold Circle + L1 while entering another screen for the Start debug menu; hold Circle + R1 for ShortCut01.
comment=Hold Circle + R2 for ShortCut02. Hold Circle + Select for the Filer debug menu.
